WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.706
Day 7. The Cat Is Big.

2
00:00:02.156 --> 00:00:09.168
Watch first. The first one on the page is written for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.668 --> 00:00:13.658
Look at the first picture. Say the sentence, and count the words: four.

4
00:00:14.108 --> 00:00:18.591
Your child writes the whole sentence, one word on each line, then the period.

5
00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:21.528
Read it back together. Then the next picture.
